STATEMENT: >>>
Import the beads design into the canon once the canon and the whiteboard are
shippable and merged to main. What the canon holds about beads today is a
small fraction of the design -- a tenth at best, by the operator's estimate on
2026-08-30. The rest lives outside the system: GitHub issues, markdown
documents and rendered artifacts. Until this work runs, the work/beads system
in any render is a stub built from the canon's WORK and EVIDENCE nodes and
nothing more; nobody designs beads beyond that, and nobody goes looking for
the outside material ahead of the import.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
